  "description": "Legroom refers to the amount of space available for a person's legs inside a vehicle or seat. In the context of the meme, it is used to describe the cramped interior space of the Humvee, implying that passengers have very little room to stretch their legs. This is a common term used in transportation and seating contexts, and the meme uses it to highlight the vehicle's uncomfortable interior.",
